  "question": {
    "text": "A white precipitate was formed when <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>BaCl</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math> was&nbsp;added to water extract of an inorganic salt. Further,&nbsp;a gas <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#39;</mo><mi>X</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></math>&nbsp;with characteristic odour was released&nbsp;when the formed white precipitate was dissolved in&nbsp;dilute HCI. The anion present in the inorganic salt is:"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><mo>-</mo></msup></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><msub><mi>SO</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo></mrow></msup></math>",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo></mrow></msup></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msubsup><mi>NO</mi><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo></msubsup></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "B"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><img src=\"assets\\st0025_c4b1dd30243d.png\" style=\"width: 342px; height: 70px;\" /></p><p>A white precipitate was formed when <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>BaCl</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;when added to water extract of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msubsup><mi>SO</mi><mn>3</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msubsup></math>&nbsp;salt. which is an&nbsp;inorganic salt.<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>white</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>pracipitate</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>of</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi>BaSO</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;is formed.&nbsp;Further,&nbsp;a gas <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>SO</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;with burning sulphur like&nbsp;odour will be released&nbsp;when the<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>BaSO</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;is&nbsp; dissolved in&nbsp;dilute HCI.</p>"
